ard Ranger (Bronze) - Boots","string":"迷途游侠（青铜）靴子","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000878|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerBoots_Bronze"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Bronze) - Gloves","string":"迷途游侠（青铜）手套","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000879|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerGloves_Bronze"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Bronze) - Armor","string":"迷途游侠（青铜）护甲","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087A|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerArmor_Bronze"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Silver) - Armor","string":"迷途游侠（银）护甲","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087B|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerArmor_Silver"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Silver)  - Boots","string":"迷途游侠（银）靴子","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087C|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerBoots_Silver"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Silver)  - Gloves","string":"迷途游侠（银）手套","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087D|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerGloves_Silver"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Silver) - Tassets","string":"迷途游侠（银）腿甲片","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087E|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerTassets_Silver"},{"original":"Wayward Ranger (Silver) - Pauldrons","string":"迷途游侠（银）肩甲","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300087F|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_ARMO_WaywardRangerPauldrons_Silver"},{"original":"Notes on Plate from a Wayward Ranger","string":"迷途游侠的板甲笔记","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000801|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_BOOK_WaywardRangerRecipe"},{"original":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\nHaving recently entertained the company of a learned Bosmer adventurer, I did inquire as to why she doth not don strong plate. She spake of desire for such defense, yet bemoaned the hindrance of movement. Nay, I doubt not the effect of full plate on one of her physique and proclivities. Yet her counsel hath revealed potential craft. These notes shall serve as a guide when I next return to the forge, to craft armor that doth accommodate both protection and agility for the wayward ranger.\n[pagebreak]\nI have assay'd divers materials for the construction of the plate:\n<p>\nSteel yieldeth a dull sturdiness, as is its wont.\nCorundum doth render plate with bronze finish.\nCorundum and malachite render a lusty, orange hue.\nGold leaveth a brown lustre, as one might expect.\nMalachite and moonstone bring forth a pure golden hue befitting of royalty.\nEbony with quicksilver doth render plate of blackest ink.\nSilver with ingot of quicksilver yieldeth a most pure, untarnished shene.\n</p>\nWhen next the two of us meet, I shall inquire as to her material preference.","string":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\n近日与一位博学的木精灵冒险者为伴，我问她为何不穿坚固的板甲。她说自己也想要这样的防护，却抱怨行动受阻。不，我并不怀疑全身板甲对她那般体格与习性之人会有何种影响。但她的见解确实显出了可行的工艺。这些笔记将作为我下次回到锻炉时的指引，为迷途游侠打造兼顾防护与敏捷的护甲。\n[pagebreak]\n我曾试过多种材料来打造板甲：\n<p>\n钢，一如它的本性，呈现出沉稳的坚韧。\n刚玉使板甲带上一层青铜色泽。\n刚玉与孔雀石调出鲜亮的橙色。\n黄金留下褐色光泽，正如人所料。\n孔雀石与月长石炼出纯正的金色，堪配王室。\n黑檀与水银使板甲黑如浓墨。\n白银与水银锭则呈现最纯净、永不晦暗的光泽。\n</p>\n待我们下次相见，我会询问她偏好何种材料。","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000801|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_BOOK_WaywardRangerRecipe"},{"original":"Places the note for the recipe in the world.","string":"将配方笔记放置到世界中。","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000800|MM2K_Wayward_Ranger.esp","type":"QUST FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"MM2K_QUST_WaywardRanger_Startup"}]